cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software to preprocess Chronicle Android raw data in a
  publication, please cite it using the metadata below. Cite the exact
  version (and contract version) that processed your data — the version is
  recorded in every run's processing report and provenance sidecar.
type: software
title: Chronicle Android Raw Data Preprocessing App
abstract: >-
  A browser-based preprocessing instrument for Chronicle Android
  usage-events data. A single Rust engine compiled to WebAssembly runs
  entirely in the user's browser and reconstructs app-usage and
  screen-usage sessions from raw interaction events under an explicit,
  versioned configuration and workflow contract. Golden-scenario tests lock
  its output, and each run can emit PROV provenance sidecars. The research
  ontology (LinkML/OWL/SHACL) that defines the instrument's measurand and
  parameters is generated from the same source of truth.
authors:
